// AWS IAM Roles Anywhere Trust Anchor Created  [tier: alert]  ATT&CK: T1098
// Detects creation of an IAM Roles Anywhere trust anchor or profile (CreateTrustAnchor/CreateProfile). This lets an external X.509…
